---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — VIRALWIRE" description="VIRALWIRE Privacy Policy.">
<section class="wrap section article">
  <div class="eyebrow">LEGAL</div>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="dek">This Privacy Policy explains how VIRALWIRE handles information when you visit and use this website.</p>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>VIRALWIRE is primarily an editorial website. We may receive information you provide directly, such as when you contact us or join the VIRALWIRE newsletter. Newsletter signups provide an email address and consent timestamp so we can maintain the subscriber list. The site may also collect technical information such as browser type, device information, approximate location, pages viewed and basic usage data through hosting, analytics or advertising services.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
    <p>We use essential technologies needed for site functionality. VIRALWIRE may also use local storage to remember preferences such as your selected theme, language and cookie-consent choice. Optional advertising or analytics technologies may set their own cookies or similar identifiers when enabled.</p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>VIRALWIRE may display advertising supplied by third-party advertising providers. Those providers may use cookies, device identifiers or similar technologies according to their own privacy policies. Advertising settings can change as our monetization partners change.</p>
    <h2>How information is used</h2>
    <p>Information may be used to operate and secure the website, understand general usage, improve editorial content and user experience, and support advertising or other site services.</p>
    <h2>Third-party links</h2>
    <p>Stories may contain links to third-party websites and services. VIRALWIRE is not responsible for the privacy practices or content of external sites.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can control cookies through your browser settings. You can also clear local storage for this website to remove saved preferences. Some site features may not work as intended if essential storage or cookies are blocked.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions or requests, use the contact method published by VIRALWIRE on its official channels.</p>
    <p><strong>Last updated: September 22, 2026.</strong></p>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>